          "question": "A particle of mass m rests in equilibrium on a fixed rough plane inclined at alpha to the horizontal, tan alpha = 3/4, under a force X acting up a line of greatest slope. The coefficient of friction is mu. When X = 2P the particle is on the point of sliding up the plane; when X = P it is on the point of sliding down. Find mu.",
