          "question": "Particle P of mass m hangs vertically below a small smooth light pulley fixed at the edge of a rough horizontal table. Particle Q of mass m is on the table, joined to P by a light inextensible string passing over the pulley. The coefficient of friction between Q and the table is mu, where mu < 1. Q is released from rest, and the tension in the string before Q hits the pulley is kmg. Find k in terms of mu.",
