          "question": "Particles P (mass m) and Q (mass km) move in opposite directions along the same horizontal straight line and collide directly. Immediately before the collision P has speed u and Q has speed 2u. As a result, the direction of motion of each particle is reversed and each speed is halved. Find the value of k.",
