          "question": "A student must prove by exhaustion that if n is an integer then 2n^2 + n + 1 is not divisible by 3. The student has started with the case n = 3k: 2n^2 + n + 1 = 18k^2 + 3k + 1 = 3(6k^2 + k) + 1, which is not divisible by 3. Complete this proof.",
